@startuml
!theme plain
autonumber

actor "Pasien MHLS" as Patient
participant "Mobile App Pasien" as Mobile
participant "Laravel Backend API" as API
database "MySQL (dsh_db)" as DB
participant "Outbox Dispatcher" as Outbox
participant "Temporal Server" as TempServer
participant "Temporal Worker\n(Workflow In-Memory)" as Worker

Patient -> Mobile : Buka menu Lapor Aktivitas\nPilih Status ('Dilaksanakan'), isi catatan
Mobile -> API : POST /api/patient/activities/{id}/report
activate API

API -> DB : BEGIN TRANSACTION
API -> DB : INSERT INTO patient_activity_reports
API -> DB : UPDATE activity_schedules SET status = 'reported'
API -> DB : INSERT INTO outbox_events (PatientActivityReported, status: 'pending')
API -> DB : COMMIT TRANSACTION
API --> Mobile : 201 Created (Laporan tersimpan di DB)
deactivate API

== Pengiriman Signal ke Temporal Workflow ==
Outbox -> DB : SELECT * FROM outbox_events WHERE status = 'pending'
DB --> Outbox : Return Event 'PatientActivityReported'

Outbox -> TempServer : SignalWorkflowExecution\n(WorkflowID: activity-plan-{id}, Signal: patient-reported-signal)
TempServer --> Outbox : Signal Delivered
Outbox -> DB : UPDATE outbox_events SET status = 'published'

TempServer -> Worker : Deliver Signal into running workflow channel
Worker -> Worker : reportSelector triggered!\nCatat laporan pasien ke WorkflowState
Worker -> Worker : Lanjutkan loop ke jadwal hari berikutnya (Durable Timer berikutnya)
@enduml
